<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies four bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies four bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Insurance Corp said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance four issues slated for competitive sale.</p>
<p>--Wynne School District #9, Ark., $1.8 million of refunding and construction bonds.</p>
<p>--Hillsborough Board Education, N.J., $39 million of school bonds.</p>
<p>--Midwest City ISD #52, Okla., $8.6 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Kirby, Texas, $985,000 of tax bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
